WEBVTT

01:38.220 --> 01:41.060
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.100 --> 01:44.020
[Episode 3]

02:21.070 --> 02:22.150
She's arrived home safely.

02:27.040 --> 02:27.800
Where are we going?

02:28.880 --> 02:29.410
To work.

02:31.310 --> 02:32.800
Isn't the Human-faced Owl already dead?

02:34.160 --> 02:36.320
[Duan's Mansion]

03:33.430 --> 03:34.360
Father is back.

03:40.840 --> 03:41.280
Father.

03:44.840 --> 03:45.310
Father?

03:48.520 --> 03:49.050
Father!

03:51.120 --> 03:51.910
What happened?

03:56.400 --> 03:57.010
Banxia.

03:57.680 --> 03:58.970
Father, what was that sound just now?

04:02.560 --> 04:04.470
I accidentally fell down.

04:04.750 --> 04:05.240
It's nothing serious.

04:05.910 --> 04:06.840
You fell?

04:07.680 --> 04:08.800
Where are you hurt?

04:09.080 --> 04:09.670
I'm alright.

04:11.360 --> 04:12.030
Why are you...

04:12.680 --> 04:13.400
Still up?

04:16.190 --> 04:18.680
I was hungry, so I went to get some food.

04:19.339 --> 04:20.610
Father, when did you come back?

04:21.170 --> 04:21.649
Just now.

04:22.730 --> 04:23.660
I just came back.

04:24.430 --> 04:25.980
A lot of things happened at home.

04:26.430 --> 04:27.360
Do you know about them?

04:32.909 --> 04:34.320
It's that new sister-in-law of mine.

04:36.360 --> 04:38.000
I'll go inside and talk to you in detail.

04:39.150 --> 04:39.630
Banxia.

04:40.390 --> 04:41.270
It's so late now.

04:41.630 --> 04:42.390
Let's talk

04:42.800 --> 04:43.800
tomorrow.

04:47.830 --> 04:48.310
I've been busy

04:48.620 --> 04:49.600
organizing manuscripts all day.

04:49.800 --> 04:50.680
I'm quite exhausted.

04:50.720 --> 04:51.670
I want to sleep early.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.440
Are you really alright?

04:58.510 --> 04:59.240
Banxia.

05:00.080 --> 05:01.320
What could possibly be wrong with me?

05:02.670 --> 05:03.280
I'm just

05:03.790 --> 05:04.830
really tired.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.070
Rest early then.

05:12.680 --> 05:14.510
Grandmother has been asking about you these days.

05:14.950 --> 05:15.560
Remember to

05:15.560 --> 05:16.800
go see her early tomorrow morning.

05:19.950 --> 05:20.800
It's been a long time

05:20.800 --> 05:21.800
since I last dyed your hair.

05:22.310 --> 05:23.320
Tomorrow when you have time,

05:23.480 --> 05:24.600
I'll dye your hair for you.

05:26.250 --> 05:26.690
Okay.

05:29.250 --> 05:30.300
I'll go back then.

05:36.730 --> 05:37.170
Banxia.

05:41.430 --> 05:42.360
It's dark.

05:44.720 --> 05:45.680
Be careful.

05:48.830 --> 05:49.480
Got it.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.090
After I leave,

05:51.390 --> 05:52.750
don't go back to reading.

05:55.000 --> 05:55.510
Got it.

06:20.360 --> 06:24.720
It's midnight. Safe and sound.

06:28.160 --> 06:32.480
It's midnight. Safe and sound.

06:59.240 --> 07:00.680
What's your name?

07:00.720 --> 07:01.600
My name is Manying.

07:03.990 --> 07:04.630
My Lady.

07:06.000 --> 07:07.190
W-What's wrong?

07:07.910 --> 07:08.760
Did you have another nightmare?

07:11.630 --> 07:12.750
Did you dream about Manying?

07:15.090 --> 07:15.680
Tingzhou.

07:17.560 --> 07:19.270
Do you think Manying might be real?

07:20.510 --> 07:21.270
Here we go again.

07:22.270 --> 07:22.870
My Lady.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.310
The physician has told you

07:24.310 --> 07:25.510
it was just a dream.

07:26.630 --> 07:27.800
You also dreamed about things like

07:28.290 --> 07:29.400
the Bat Spirit

07:29.560 --> 07:30.360
and the Black Panther Demon.

07:30.720 --> 07:32.000
How could it be real?

07:33.770 --> 07:34.330
But if

07:34.360 --> 07:35.800
there really are demons in this world,

07:36.720 --> 07:38.040
does that mean

07:38.720 --> 07:40.040
my dream was real,

07:40.310 --> 07:41.650
the people inside my dream are real,

07:41.680 --> 07:42.720
and Manying is also a real person?

07:42.750 --> 07:43.480
My Lady.

07:44.230 --> 07:45.080
It's so early in the morning.

07:45.110 --> 07:46.280
Instead of thinking about this,

07:46.480 --> 07:47.120
maybe you should think about

07:47.150 --> 07:48.800
how to respond to Elder Madam.

07:49.630 --> 07:51.120
Master has been gone for days.

07:51.800 --> 07:53.240
Elder Madam is obviously angry.

07:53.560 --> 07:54.600
My father has come back.

07:55.990 --> 07:56.800
He's back?

07:57.980 --> 07:58.780
When?

07:59.310 --> 08:00.110
Last night.

08:01.130 --> 08:02.130
Go get me some water.

08:02.390 --> 08:03.850
I'll wash up and go see my father.

08:04.240 --> 08:04.750
Okay.

08:07.750 --> 08:08.740
Clean this area more thoroughly.

08:09.730 --> 08:11.020
Alright, give it another wipe.

08:11.750 --> 08:12.560
Mr. Xu.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.070
My Lady.

08:16.000 --> 08:17.160
Is my father inside?

08:18.980 --> 08:20.010
Has the Second Master come back?

08:29.430 --> 08:29.950
Make way!

08:35.320 --> 08:35.840
This way.

08:57.030 --> 08:57.820
Yingheng.

09:04.000 --> 09:04.670
Yingheng.

09:09.240 --> 09:10.030
How could this happen?

09:12.760 --> 09:13.600
How could this happen?

09:27.910 --> 09:28.320
I...

09:29.360 --> 09:30.480
M... My father...

09:35.240 --> 09:37.120
Why is my father here?

09:37.720 --> 09:38.480
This mansion

09:38.930 --> 09:39.840
was originally a residence affiliated with

09:39.860 --> 09:41.390
the Yunqing Trading Company.

09:42.270 --> 09:43.670
The company usually earns some money

09:44.180 --> 09:45.010
through renting out properties.

09:46.090 --> 09:47.020
Recently,

09:47.910 --> 09:49.200
Uncle Yingheng rented this place

09:49.980 --> 09:51.500
and has been living here for several days straight.

09:52.390 --> 09:53.510
Last night between 9 to 11 p.m.,

09:54.150 --> 09:54.910
the woodshed caught fire.

09:55.720 --> 09:56.440
The fire was huge,

09:57.510 --> 09:59.320
and it spread to this courtyard very fast.

10:00.390 --> 10:01.240
I guess Uncle Yingheng...

10:03.120 --> 10:04.600
Had nowhere to escape,

10:05.510 --> 10:06.960
so he hid back in the study.

10:07.910 --> 10:08.550
In the end,

10:10.670 --> 10:12.270
he was suffocated to death in here.

10:15.790 --> 10:16.670
Yingheng!

10:18.320 --> 10:19.120
Yingheng...

10:21.910 --> 10:22.480
Yanqiu.

10:23.240 --> 10:23.840
That's impossible.

10:24.730 --> 10:25.690
I saw my father

10:25.720 --> 10:26.720
at midnight last night.

10:27.380 --> 10:29.300
My father had lost a lot of weight

10:29.550 --> 10:30.240
and looked haggard at that time.

10:30.270 --> 10:30.550
I...

10:30.630 --> 10:31.880
I noticed he has grown a lot of gray hair,

10:32.090 --> 10:32.600
and he agreed

10:32.630 --> 10:34.150
to let me dye his hair today.

10:34.430 --> 10:34.820
It's true!

10:35.030 --> 10:35.480
Banxia.

10:36.840 --> 10:38.000
He's already passed away.

10:38.910 --> 10:39.790
No! Trust me!

10:39.820 --> 10:41.120
I saw him last night.

10:41.150 --> 10:42.410
He couldn't be dead.

10:42.440 --> 10:43.150
Banxia!

10:43.880 --> 10:45.120
The fact is already right in front of us.

10:45.150 --> 10:46.700
You still won't believe it?

10:50.890 --> 10:52.250
Something must be wrong.

10:55.450 --> 10:56.540
My father is not dead.

10:59.240 --> 11:00.190
My father is not dead.

11:02.870 --> 11:03.630
I saw him.

11:06.870 --> 11:07.480
He can't be dead.

11:08.720 --> 11:09.440
He's not dead.

11:19.250 --> 11:20.100
This can't be.

11:21.960 --> 11:23.050
My father is not dead.

11:24.390 --> 11:26.000
There must be something wrong somewhere.

12:03.810 --> 12:04.970
What on earth are you doing?

12:06.330 --> 12:07.090
Luring the sound eel out.

12:08.110 --> 12:09.970
The sound eel is the Human-faced Owl's companion demon.

12:10.120 --> 12:10.990
Since the Human-faced Owl died,

12:11.390 --> 12:12.720
the sound eel will definitely avenge her.

12:13.390 --> 12:14.390
Didn't you say

12:14.410 --> 12:16.050
the sound eel was born with poor eyesight,

12:16.140 --> 12:17.090
but it has exceptional hearing

12:17.120 --> 12:18.440
and loves beautiful sounds?

12:18.750 --> 12:19.360
Then I can definitely lure it here

12:19.360 --> 12:20.480
with my flute.

12:21.620 --> 12:23.150
You call this a beautiful sound?

12:23.720 --> 12:24.360
Isn't it beautiful?

12:27.390 --> 12:28.150
If you don't play the flute,

12:28.320 --> 12:29.650
it may come faster.

13:00.750 --> 13:01.360
It's here?

13:02.480 --> 13:03.120
Be careful.

13:12.080 --> 13:12.630
Chi Xue!

13:33.320 --> 13:36.220
[Sound Eel]

14:03.170 --> 14:03.740
Chi Xue.

14:03.870 --> 14:04.510
Cut the rope!

14:15.800 --> 14:16.750
You can't run away now, can you?

15:11.000 --> 15:12.750
What a small world.

15:13.650 --> 15:14.530
We meet again, guys.

15:22.240 --> 15:23.170
What are you doing here?

15:24.490 --> 15:25.080
I hope I'm not ruining

15:25.100 --> 15:26.100
any of your fun, Physician Jiu.

15:26.970 --> 15:27.740
What do you want?

15:29.200 --> 15:29.670
Nothing.

15:30.720 --> 15:31.760
It's just the weather is nice,

15:32.240 --> 15:32.940
so I came out for a walk.

15:34.360 --> 15:35.030
Are you going back to the city?

15:35.920 --> 15:36.750
How about we go together?

15:37.760 --> 15:38.330
It's out of your way.

15:38.780 --> 15:39.390
It's not.

15:39.810 --> 15:40.930
No matter where you want to go, Physician Jiu,

15:41.320 --> 15:42.270
it's on my way.

15:44.000 --> 15:44.630
Chi Xue.

15:44.960 --> 15:45.440
Let's go.

15:49.320 --> 15:50.390
Hey, let's go together.

16:17.960 --> 16:19.720
W-Was this place robbed?

16:19.720 --> 16:20.390
My Lady.

16:45.340 --> 16:46.460
Why is it so messy here?

16:47.600 --> 16:49.080
Was Father planning to travel far?

17:01.390 --> 17:02.270
M-My Lady!

17:03.230 --> 17:03.900
Come here!

17:04.550 --> 17:05.069
Look.

17:05.920 --> 17:06.440
Here.

17:08.000 --> 17:08.550
Look at this.

17:11.480 --> 17:12.069
Why is this mirror

17:12.069 --> 17:13.310
not reflecting us?

18:09.400 --> 18:12.460
[Duan's Mansion]

18:11.110 --> 18:12.750
My poor girl.

18:13.400 --> 18:15.070
Your mother died when you were still little,

18:15.670 --> 18:17.870
and now, you've lost your father too.

18:18.590 --> 18:19.760
How should you live

18:19.790 --> 18:21.240
alone in this world

18:21.880 --> 18:24.310
from now on?

18:26.880 --> 18:27.580
Grandmother,

18:28.350 --> 18:29.390
please don't be sad.

18:31.160 --> 18:32.510
My father might still be alive.

18:39.150 --> 18:40.630
At midnight the day before yesterday,

18:41.270 --> 18:43.000
I saw my father come home with my own eyes.

18:43.160 --> 18:44.160
He was right in his room.

18:45.510 --> 18:47.200
He seemed to be in good spirits at that time,

18:47.710 --> 18:49.270
but he did look a bit tired.

18:49.630 --> 18:50.310
He said it was because

18:50.330 --> 18:51.370
he hadn't rested well

18:51.400 --> 18:52.240
since he'd been organizing manuscripts.

18:52.720 --> 18:54.200
Therefore, I didn't talk to him for long.

18:54.640 --> 18:55.840
On my way back to my room,

18:56.000 --> 18:57.350
I heard the watchman beating his drum.

18:57.640 --> 18:59.340
He clearly struck it three times.

19:00.000 --> 19:01.410
But the government file stated that

19:01.510 --> 19:03.310
my father died before 11 p.m.

19:03.920 --> 19:04.640
Think about it.

19:05.270 --> 19:06.750
If he had died before 11 p.m.,

19:06.920 --> 19:07.590
how could he have come home

19:07.610 --> 19:08.730
at midnight?

19:09.240 --> 19:10.640
There must be something fishy about this.

19:11.480 --> 19:12.650
My father must still be alive.

19:13.200 --> 19:14.030
This... This...

19:15.030 --> 19:16.310
Could it be she ran into a ghost?

19:16.790 --> 19:17.350
Banxia.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.880
I know you're feeling heartbroken,

19:20.270 --> 19:20.550
but...

19:20.680 --> 19:21.510
Uncle.

19:22.160 --> 19:23.480
I'm not saying this

19:23.750 --> 19:24.680
out of excessive sadness.

19:25.790 --> 19:26.680
You all know that

19:27.200 --> 19:27.920
my eyes have been different

19:27.920 --> 19:29.170
from those of ordinary people since childhood.

19:29.510 --> 19:30.980
If this were caused by ghosts or demons,

19:31.060 --> 19:32.520
I'd definitely be able to tell.

19:34.920 --> 19:36.000
Uncle Yingheng lived in the east courtyard,

19:36.260 --> 19:37.350
while you live in the west courtyard.

19:37.700 --> 19:38.790
The two sides are very far apart.

19:39.350 --> 19:40.330
Why didn't you sleep that night

19:40.720 --> 19:41.920
and went to Uncle Yingheng's room instead?

19:43.550 --> 19:45.110
I didn't go there from my room.

19:45.550 --> 19:47.000
Actually, I saw the lights were on

19:47.310 --> 19:48.340
in my father's room when I came back

19:48.370 --> 19:49.040
from outside.

19:49.270 --> 19:50.260
So I went to check.

19:51.100 --> 19:51.600
At such a late hour,

19:51.620 --> 19:52.420
where did you go?

19:53.920 --> 19:54.510
I...

19:58.310 --> 19:59.680
I went to see a friend.

20:00.230 --> 20:01.720
You live in Yuanzhou year-round.

20:02.110 --> 20:03.680
Why do you have friends in Nanyang City?

20:04.830 --> 20:06.070
I'm not lying.

20:08.800 --> 20:09.660
Mr. Xu.

20:10.350 --> 20:11.130
I saw Mr. Xu changing the candles

20:11.160 --> 20:12.870
when I came back.

20:13.070 --> 20:13.650
That's when

20:13.680 --> 20:14.830
his hand got scalded.

20:15.240 --> 20:16.240
I saw him first,

20:16.270 --> 20:17.350
and then my father.

20:20.510 --> 20:21.000
Young Master.

20:21.680 --> 20:23.240
My hand was indeed

20:23.550 --> 20:24.480
scalded when

20:25.070 --> 20:26.240
changing the candles

20:26.510 --> 20:27.160
the night before last.

20:27.640 --> 20:29.460
It was exactly at midnight.

20:30.830 --> 20:31.310
My Lady.

20:31.850 --> 20:33.000
I didn't see you

20:33.030 --> 20:34.000
when I changed the candles.

20:35.660 --> 20:37.140
I came back too late.

20:37.720 --> 20:38.930
I didn't want to be scolded by Grandmother,

20:38.950 --> 20:39.780
so I hid myself.

20:41.290 --> 20:42.930
Mr. Xu's hand injury is not a secret.

20:43.490 --> 20:44.080
This still can't prove

20:44.110 --> 20:45.010
what you said is true.

20:45.980 --> 20:47.740
I know what I said is hard to believe,

20:48.470 --> 20:49.660
but think about it carefully.

20:49.690 --> 20:50.790
Don't you find it strange?

20:51.540 --> 20:52.610
My father and I came back this time

20:52.640 --> 20:54.120
for Yanqiu's marriage.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.720
But as soon as he came back,

20:55.740 --> 20:57.260
he rented a mansion outside,

20:58.000 --> 20:59.080
and he didn't come back often.

20:59.370 --> 21:00.090
as if he was

21:00.110 --> 21:00.960
hiding from something.

21:02.170 --> 21:03.960
Uncle Yingheng asked me to rent that mansion for him.

21:04.230 --> 21:05.800
He said it was to organize manuscripts peacefully,

21:06.210 --> 21:07.410
not to avoid anyone.

21:09.280 --> 21:10.330
The weather and the life

21:10.790 --> 21:11.790
are both unpredictable.

21:12.650 --> 21:13.170
Banxia.

21:13.740 --> 21:14.980
I know it's hard for you to accept

21:15.000 --> 21:15.870
Uncle Yingheng's death right now.

21:16.480 --> 21:17.350
But now that it's come to this,

21:17.880 --> 21:18.440
you must stay strong.

21:21.310 --> 21:22.400
Tingzhou, the mirror.

21:25.060 --> 21:26.130
I found this mirror

21:26.160 --> 21:27.490
in my father's room.

21:27.840 --> 21:28.970
It can only reflect objects,

21:29.000 --> 21:29.930
not people.

21:30.330 --> 21:31.280
I went to the fire scene

21:31.300 --> 21:32.020
at Penglai Alley

21:32.440 --> 21:33.080
and found a mirror

21:33.110 --> 21:34.030
which is exactly the same as this one.

21:34.510 --> 21:35.830
Isn't this suspicious enough?

21:36.940 --> 21:37.340
This...

21:47.480 --> 21:48.280
How could this be?

21:49.030 --> 21:49.750
No way.

21:50.330 --> 21:50.890
It clearly couldn't

21:50.920 --> 21:51.990
reflect anything yesterday.

21:52.240 --> 21:53.480
Tingzhou, you saw it too, right?

21:54.830 --> 21:55.330
Yes.

21:55.550 --> 21:56.480
I saw it too.

21:57.340 --> 21:58.470
It couldn't reflect people.

22:02.480 --> 22:03.110
I know.

22:05.200 --> 22:07.160
It must have been a powerful demon

22:07.400 --> 22:08.640
using a deceptive spell.

22:08.880 --> 22:10.000
That's why we couldn't see it.

22:11.070 --> 22:12.310
I know a demon hunter.

22:12.720 --> 22:13.510
-We can…
-Banxia!

22:17.720 --> 22:18.240
Tingzhou.

22:18.850 --> 22:19.810
Help your lady back to her room.

22:25.640 --> 22:26.270
Why?

22:31.180 --> 22:31.990
Why can't you

22:32.020 --> 22:33.630
believe me even for once?

22:39.070 --> 22:40.400
I'll take you to Jishi Clinic later

22:41.160 --> 22:41.750
to see Physician Sun.

22:42.270 --> 22:43.480
I'm not sick!

22:44.440 --> 22:46.160
I said my father is still alive!

22:46.240 --> 22:47.800
These are all caused by demons!

22:47.830 --> 22:48.350
Demons?

22:49.110 --> 22:49.920
Demons again?

22:50.480 --> 22:51.000
How come only you

22:51.030 --> 22:52.190
can see those demons?

22:52.240 --> 22:53.720
Why can't I see any of them?

22:54.130 --> 22:54.850
You have.

22:56.260 --> 22:57.500
You all have!

22:58.400 --> 22:59.280
It's just that you couldn't see through

22:59.310 --> 23:00.550
her disguise.

23:02.890 --> 23:04.540
Don't tell me you still think that

23:05.020 --> 23:06.780
Sister-in-law was abducted by a villain.

23:08.830 --> 23:10.070
She's a demon,

23:11.540 --> 23:13.060
a Human-faced Owl,

23:13.960 --> 23:15.350
with a monkey's body and a dog's tail,

23:15.680 --> 23:16.760
which likes to eat human throats.

23:16.790 --> 23:17.790
She approached you just to...

23:17.810 --> 23:18.650
Shut up!

23:34.480 --> 23:35.030
Sir, welcome.

23:36.080 --> 23:37.000
Sir, welcome.

23:37.000 --> 23:37.750
Please, come in.

23:38.790 --> 23:39.870
Mr. Zhang.

23:41.680 --> 23:42.920
Sir, please come inside.

23:43.350 --> 23:43.790
Please, come in.

23:44.070 --> 23:45.550
This is your first time here, right, Sir?

23:46.350 --> 23:46.910
Please, come in.

23:53.960 --> 23:55.640
Come on. This way.

23:55.640 --> 23:57.160
Have another drink.

23:58.510 --> 23:59.640
Is this your first time here?

24:23.720 --> 24:24.440
Where did you come from, you brute?

24:31.010 --> 24:31.930
How dare you hit me?

24:35.080 --> 24:35.720
Mr. Song.

24:35.920 --> 24:36.440
Mr. Song!

24:37.160 --> 24:38.290
Why are you leaving?

24:40.480 --> 24:41.110
Sir,

24:42.110 --> 24:42.590
Chuntao

24:42.880 --> 24:44.550
already has a guest today.

24:44.820 --> 24:45.230
How about

24:45.310 --> 24:46.480
I arrange some other girl

24:46.510 --> 24:46.960
for you?

24:50.630 --> 24:51.740
I won't disturb you any further.

24:51.900 --> 24:52.310
Chuntao.

24:52.620 --> 24:53.470
Take good care of this gentleman here.

25:11.000 --> 25:11.480
Sir.

25:12.030 --> 25:13.640
Your bamboo hat...

25:14.170 --> 25:15.540
Keep playing!

25:41.760 --> 25:42.310
In the future,

25:42.780 --> 25:44.200
if you encounter any trouble,

25:44.840 --> 25:46.090
you can come to Guangping City to find me.

25:51.830 --> 25:52.430
My Lady.

25:53.110 --> 25:53.800
It's time to take your medicine.

25:57.160 --> 25:58.310
They don't believe me,

25:59.090 --> 26:00.060
and you don't, either?

26:01.730 --> 26:03.250
Of course I believe you, My Lady.

26:04.280 --> 26:05.390
But what's the use

26:05.410 --> 26:05.940
of me being the only one

26:05.970 --> 26:06.770
who believes you, My Lady?

26:08.130 --> 26:09.650
All others, including Young Master, don’t believe you.

26:13.000 --> 26:13.880
I don't need them.

26:18.960 --> 26:20.210
We've been looking for so long and still haven't found him.

26:20.550 --> 26:21.790
Do you think he might have run far away?

26:22.510 --> 26:23.070
No.

26:23.550 --> 26:24.780
He must be nearby.

26:25.030 --> 26:25.510
Why?

26:26.930 --> 26:28.340
Sound eels are different from other demons.

26:28.640 --> 26:30.270
For him, beautiful sounds

26:30.270 --> 26:31.110
are both food

26:31.160 --> 26:32.110
and medicine.

26:32.640 --> 26:33.440
Since he's injured,

26:33.720 --> 26:34.640
he'll definitely search for

26:34.640 --> 26:35.760
beautiful sounds in the city

26:35.790 --> 26:36.720
to heal himself.

26:45.330 --> 26:46.610
He just won't leave us alone.

27:11.030 --> 27:12.030
What should we do?

27:14.010 --> 27:15.250
She's been playing the whole night.

27:15.740 --> 27:16.740
Why haven't they come out yet?

27:17.240 --> 27:18.200
Exactly, Madame.

27:18.590 --> 27:19.070
Madame.

27:19.510 --> 27:20.690
How about we report it to the government?

27:20.960 --> 27:21.640
Right.

27:21.660 --> 27:22.100
Right.

27:22.200 --> 27:23.830
Madame, it's a matter of life and death.

27:24.030 --> 27:25.000
It's a matter of life and death, Madame.

27:25.030 --> 27:25.510
Right.

27:26.240 --> 27:26.680
Alright.

27:27.790 --> 27:28.270
Let's report this to the government.

27:29.810 --> 27:30.300
Qiusheng!

27:30.920 --> 27:31.400
Come here.

27:32.830 --> 27:33.240
Come on.

27:33.630 --> 27:34.480
You're the fastest.

27:34.750 --> 27:35.340
Go to the government office

27:35.550 --> 27:36.320
and ask Chief Constable Song

27:36.350 --> 27:37.510
to bring enough people over.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.300
Go quickly.

27:38.540 --> 27:39.060
Yes.

27:44.620 --> 27:45.970
Why are you so flustered?

27:47.480 --> 27:48.550
Do you know Chief Constable Song?

27:48.570 --> 27:49.110
Yes, I do.

27:49.310 --> 27:50.550
Come with me and report to the government.

27:51.240 --> 27:51.790
Report to the government?

27:52.680 --> 27:53.490
Let's go. Someone is causing trouble.

28:06.030 --> 28:06.880
May I ask who you are...

28:25.310 --> 28:26.720
Quite the refined entertainment, isn't it?

28:27.550 --> 28:30.000
If she keeps playing, she'll bleed out.

28:31.750 --> 28:32.520
Young lady?

28:42.360 --> 28:43.210
You've woken up?

28:45.160 --> 28:46.350
Wearing a bamboo hat indoors,

28:46.930 --> 28:47.720
don't you feel stifled?

28:49.350 --> 28:50.110
Run while you still can.

29:56.960 --> 29:58.200
You're really getting uglier and uglier.

30:45.550 --> 30:46.180
Chi Xue.

30:46.590 --> 30:47.160
Take it away.

31:12.140 --> 31:13.540
I received a letter from your fiancé.

31:15.070 --> 31:16.290
He knows what happened to your father.

31:16.720 --> 31:18.020
He said he'd come to Nanyang

31:18.550 --> 31:19.400
as soon as he finishes his work.

31:22.310 --> 31:23.030
I've inquired about him.

31:23.440 --> 31:24.560
He's a good guy.

31:24.920 --> 31:25.830
Pretty talented.

31:26.830 --> 31:27.880
Uncle Yingheng had good taste.

31:34.640 --> 31:35.240
Banxia.

31:36.720 --> 31:37.790
I've got news about Manniang.

31:41.510 --> 31:42.400
Do you still remember

31:42.550 --> 31:43.410
that throat-slitting scoundrel

31:43.440 --> 31:44.640
in the city recently?

31:45.930 --> 31:47.250
Guangping has sent an official arrest warrant.

31:48.030 --> 31:49.200
The scoundrel on the portrait

31:50.160 --> 31:50.960
is Manniang.

31:53.750 --> 31:54.500
Do you believe it?

31:55.350 --> 31:56.350
I will go investigate it.

31:58.960 --> 32:00.030
So you still don't believe it.

32:00.070 --> 32:01.590
Of course I don't believe it.

32:02.680 --> 32:04.270
She's just a weak woman.

32:11.480 --> 32:12.680
I'll continue to investigate.

32:14.130 --> 32:15.360
But regardless,

32:15.850 --> 32:16.760
there are no demons in this world,

32:16.790 --> 32:17.750
and that's a fact.

32:21.050 --> 32:21.400
So,

32:21.420 --> 32:22.550
you should stop overthinking it.

32:24.110 --> 32:24.830
Now,

32:25.350 --> 32:26.510
although Uncle Yingheng is gone,

32:27.830 --> 32:29.110
we will take good care of you.

32:32.810 --> 32:33.590
I understand.

32:38.030 --> 32:38.790
It's raining.

32:39.060 --> 32:39.740
Let me walk you back.

32:40.490 --> 32:41.000
No need.

32:42.470 --> 32:43.780
I can go back by myself.

32:45.920 --> 32:47.520
Go back and rest early.

33:13.740 --> 33:14.460
My Lady.

33:14.700 --> 33:15.830
I've finished packing.

33:16.850 --> 33:17.370
Okay.

33:27.540 --> 33:28.020
Let's go.

33:34.910 --> 33:37.470
[To Yanqiu]

33:43.610 --> 33:44.370
It's raining so heavily.

33:47.600 --> 33:48.230
Mister.

33:48.820 --> 33:50.300
Is there a ferry dock ahead

33:50.570 --> 33:51.850
where there are boats to Guangping every day?

33:52.060 --> 33:52.980
Do you know

33:52.980 --> 33:53.950
when that boat comes?

33:54.100 --> 33:54.860
Every day at noon.

33:56.530 --> 33:57.600
Are you taking a boat to Guangping?

34:00.280 --> 34:01.790
The boat only comes once a day.

34:02.600 --> 34:03.340
It's raining so heavily.

34:03.840 --> 34:05.010
I'm afraid you won't make it today.

34:05.030 --> 34:05.670
Wait until tomorrow.

34:08.219 --> 34:09.030
My Lady.

34:10.370 --> 34:11.969
How about we go back?

34:14.639 --> 34:15.800
When will this rain stop?

34:28.870 --> 34:29.469
Let's go.

34:33.610 --> 34:37.139
[Guangping City]

34:55.600 --> 34:56.199
What should we do about him?

34:57.050 --> 34:58.240
When the full moon arrives,

34:58.410 --> 34:59.320
I'll deal with him.

34:59.850 --> 35:00.410
Alright.

35:06.600 --> 35:07.450
You're a demon yourself too.

35:08.010 --> 35:08.850
Why are you so rude

35:08.850 --> 35:09.800
to someone of your own kind?

35:10.570 --> 35:11.680
I'm nothing like him.

35:12.010 --> 35:13.040
He's so stupid.

35:13.450 --> 35:14.090
If I were him

35:14.120 --> 35:15.280
and encountered such a formidable opponent like you,

35:16.060 --> 35:17.190
I would have probably disappeared by now.

35:17.930 --> 35:19.570
Companion demons are very loyal.

35:20.250 --> 35:21.170
Once they've chosen their master,

35:21.200 --> 35:22.160
they'll never regret it even if they die a hundred times.

35:22.960 --> 35:24.160
I killed the Human-faced Owl.

35:24.570 --> 35:25.990
Of course he wants to avenge his master

35:26.400 --> 35:27.610
by staying close to his enemy

35:27.640 --> 35:28.420
and waiting for the right time.

35:30.320 --> 35:31.010
This sound eel

35:31.160 --> 35:32.120
is actually quite loyal.

35:37.180 --> 35:37.990
Keep a close eye on it.

36:01.970 --> 36:04.850
♫A familiar figure♫

36:05.330 --> 36:08.440
♫Becomes clear in the haze♫

36:08.970 --> 36:13.400
♫Yet it's out of reach♫

36:15.820 --> 36:18.790
♫Your earnest reminders♫

36:19.320 --> 36:22.150
♫And words of concern♫

36:20.600 --> 36:21.450
Xuanye, you're back.

36:22.280 --> 36:23.280
He came back pretty quickly this time.

36:22.900 --> 36:29.050
♫They've woven and colored the time we shared♫

36:23.320 --> 36:23.600
Yes.

36:24.090 --> 36:25.970
But he still didn't make it in time for your wedding.

36:26.120 --> 36:26.640
It's okay.

36:26.800 --> 36:27.680
There will be a next time.

36:29.790 --> 36:32.810
♫Traces of bond♫

36:29.850 --> 36:31.280
Maybe there'll even be a third time.

36:33.290 --> 36:36.300
♫With a sigh, we bid farewell♫

36:36.770 --> 36:42.300
♫Keeping you company, and seeing you off on a long journey♫

36:37.050 --> 36:38.050
So you know to come back?

36:38.850 --> 36:39.570
Look at these.

36:40.010 --> 36:41.320
How long have you been wearing these shoes?

36:41.600 --> 36:42.160
They're so dirty.

36:43.050 --> 36:43.970
I'll wash them for you.

36:43.440 --> 36:46.600
♫You're the same as before♫

36:47.080 --> 36:50.550
♫And I'm still following closely behind♫

36:47.370 --> 36:47.930
Xuanye.

36:49.450 --> 36:50.290
Now I finally know

36:50.320 --> 36:51.090
what Moon Bugs like to eat.

36:50.720 --> 36:56.310
♫Remember it day and night♫

36:51.680 --> 36:52.830
They like to eat lamb lung soup.

36:53.320 --> 36:54.820
Don't put any oil, salt, sauce or vinegar in it.

36:54.850 --> 36:55.900
Just boil it in plain water

36:55.970 --> 36:56.900
for a few hours.

36:57.190 --> 36:58.970
♫One side is the past♫

36:57.610 --> 36:59.090
They'll finish it in a blink of an eye.

36:58.990 --> 37:03.300
♫Where you lingered♫

37:02.450 --> 37:02.970
Just wait.

37:03.450 --> 37:04.240
Wait for my Moon Bugs

37:04.040 --> 37:05.800
♫The other is the unforgettable♫

37:04.280 --> 37:05.240
to grow big and strong.

37:05.530 --> 37:06.120
I guarantee that if you carry them with you,

37:05.820 --> 37:09.800
♫Dream of mine♫

37:06.370 --> 37:07.320
even a century-old demon

37:07.410 --> 37:08.320
will be terrified and run away.

37:11.100 --> 37:14.210
♫A fallen leaf, a drop of wine♫

37:14.560 --> 37:17.310
♫Each drop into my heart♫

37:17.370 --> 37:18.370
Did your trip this time go well?

37:18.080 --> 37:23.490
♫A moment of memory, an illusion♫

37:24.970 --> 37:26.740
♫One side is the past♫

37:25.030 --> 37:25.680
Son.

37:26.760 --> 37:31.050
♫Where you lingered♫

37:26.970 --> 37:27.970
People can be good or bad,

37:28.490 --> 37:30.120
and the same goes for demons.

37:30.640 --> 37:31.760
You can't generalize.

37:31.960 --> 37:33.550
♫The other is the unforgettable♫

37:32.490 --> 37:33.120
Got it?

37:33.580 --> 37:37.300
♫Dream of mine♫

37:36.680 --> 37:37.410
Yes.

37:38.810 --> 37:41.880
♫A fallen leaf, a drop of wine♫

37:42.330 --> 37:45.400
♫Each drop into my heart♫

37:45.810 --> 37:51.360
♫A moment of memory, an illusion♫

37:52.350 --> 37:58.010
♫A segment of reminiscence engraved for a lifetime♫

37:54.240 --> 37:55.970
The starry sky is really bright tonight.

38:44.570 --> 38:45.160
So delicious.

39:04.340 --> 39:07.460
[Zhang's Mansion]

39:13.490 --> 39:14.760
Between 7 to 9 p.m.,

39:15.240 --> 39:16.490
the moon hangs low.

39:17.240 --> 39:19.800
Pear Fairy, listen to my words.

39:20.930 --> 39:23.490
I'm not blinded by money,

39:24.320 --> 39:26.640
nor am I seeking a good marriage.

39:28.340 --> 39:29.340
Between 9 to 11 p.m.,

39:30.200 --> 39:31.450
the moonlight is cold.

39:32.650 --> 39:35.170
Pear Fairy, come to my courtyard.

39:36.010 --> 39:37.930
I'm not lamenting in front of the mirror,

39:38.680 --> 39:40.970
nor am I foolishly seeking to extend my life.

39:41.930 --> 39:43.240
At midnight,

39:43.640 --> 39:44.600
the moonlight is dim.

39:45.420 --> 39:47.670
Pear Fairy, listen to my wishes.

39:48.570 --> 39:50.680
First wish: the flowers bloom again,

39:51.280 --> 39:52.930
life and death I bear.

39:55.240 --> 39:57.160
Second wish: I offer my bones and blood,

39:58.380 --> 40:01.020
just to be young again.

40:49.370 --> 40:50.080
Eat it.

40:53.490 --> 40:54.200
Come on, eat it.

41:02.100 --> 41:02.920
Come on.

41:04.390 --> 41:05.440
Eat it.

41:06.670 --> 41:07.630
Come on, eat it.

41:16.970 --> 41:21.280
It's midnight. Safe and sound.

41:33.980 --> 41:38.340
It's midnight. Safe and sound.

42:23.970 --> 42:24.680
Chi Xue!

42:54.570 --> 42:55.160
Chi Xue.

42:56.010 --> 42:56.490
Go back.

42:57.890 --> 42:58.280
In a minute.

42:58.530 --> 42:59.090
Hurry up.

43:03.010 --> 43:03.890
Boss, on credit.

43:08.280 --> 43:09.280
Manniang's sister-in-law.
